          { "type": "FIRST_TOKEN", "e2e_ttft_ms": 1762, "ttft_ms": 1762, "timestamp": 1784601647373 },
          { "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_START", "messageId": "text-msg-d3724311", "parentMessageId": "48987395-7ff7-4c62-8e50-67d746f1b802", "role": "assistant", "timestamp": 1784601651939 },
          { "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT", "delta": "Java 标准库没有直接提供\"单调队列\"的封装类，但可以用 `Deque`（双端队列）轻松实现。我先拉取题目详情，再给你讲解单调队列的解法。\n\n", "messageId": "text-msg-d3724311", "timestamp": 1784601651939 },
          { "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_END", "messageId": "text-msg-d3724311", "timestamp": 1784601654109 },
          { "type": "ACTIVITY_SNAPSHOT", "activityType": "FILE_READ", "messageId": "call_6c3563b99f4f4d67bbd8bc1d", "parentMessageId": "48987395-7ff7-4c62-8e50-67d746f1b802", "timestamp": 1784601654109, "content": { "path": "https://leetcode.cn/problems/sliding-window-maximum/description/", "content": "URL: https://leetcode.cn/problems/sliding-window-maximum/\nContent length: 1456 chars\n给你一个整数数组 nums，滑动窗口大小为 k，返回滑动窗口中的最大值。", "snippet": "获取滑动窗口最大值题目详情", "start_time": 1784601654109, "finish_time": 1784601663129, "status": "completed" } },
          { "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_START", "messageId": "text-msg-83ee38d8", "parentMessageId": "48987395-7ff7-4c62-8e50-67d746f1b802", "role": "assistant", "timestamp": 1784601665677 },
          { "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT", "delta": "好的，题目详情已经获取。现在我来为你详细解答这两个问题：\n\n## 1. Java 中是否有现成的单调队列实现？\n\n**Java 标准库（JDK）中没有直接名为\"Monotonic Queue\"的封装类。** 但你可以使用 `java.util.Deque`（双端队列接口），通常用 `ArrayDeque` 来实现单调队列。\n\n## 2. 单调队列如何解决\"滑动窗口最大值\"\n\n维护一个**单调递减**的队列，存储数组元素的下标。\n\n```java\nimport java.util.ArrayDeque;\nimport java.util.Deque;\n\nclass Solution {\n    public int[] maxSlidingWindow(int[] nums, int k) {\n        int n = nums.length;\n        int[] result = new int[n - k + 1];\n        Deque<Integer> deque = new ArrayDeque<>();\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            while (!deque.isEmpty() && nums[deque.peekLast()] <= nums[i]) deque.pollLast();\n            deque.offerLast(i);\n            if (deque.peekFirst() <= i - k) deque.pollFirst();\n            if (i >= k - 1) result[i - k + 1] = nums[deque.peekFirst()];\n        }\n        return result;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 复杂度分析\n- **时间复杂度**：O(n)。\n- **空间复杂度**：O(k)。", "messageId": "text-msg-83ee38d8", "timestamp": 1784601665677 },
